    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "<h3> IT Systems Area </h3> <h1> IT Administrator (m/f/d) – IT Infrastructure &amp; Support </h1>",
      "body": "<p><a href=\"/fileadmin/01_Pages/Company/Career/DE/IT_Administrator_2026_06_18_ZOLLER.pdf\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Job Posting (PDF)</a></p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "textmedia",
      "id": "c97999",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h4>Your Profile</h4><ul><li>Completed training as an IT specialist for system integration or a comparable qualification in the IT area</li><li>Professional experience in IT support and in the administration of Windows client and server environments</li><li>Strong knowledge of the Microsoft ecosystem (Windows Server, Active Directory, Microsoft 365)</li><li>Experience with handling software deployment solutions and client management is a plus</li><li>Basic knowledge in the areas of virtualization (VMware vSphere), backup solutions, and networking</li><li>A service- and solution-oriented approach to work, as well as a passion for handling applications</li><li>A structured, independent, and responsible work style</li><li>Ability to work well in a team, strong communication skills, and a high level of commitment</li><li>Very good command of German and good written<br/> and spoken English</li></ul><h4>Your Responsibilities</h4><ul><li>Point of contact for employees regarding IT questions and technical faults (1st and 2nd level support), as well as analyzing, editing, and documenting support requests</li><li>Setup, support, and maintenance of PCs, laptops, printers, and mobile devices, including Mobile Device Management (iPhone/iPad)</li><li>User and access rights management, as well as providing support to our national and international locations regarding </li><li>IT-related relevant issues</li><li>Administration and support of the Windows server environment, Active Directory, Exchange, and other central infrastructure services</li><li>Software distribution and packaging via the central software distribution system (Microsoft Intune)</li><li>Support for the operation and further development of the virtualization environment (VMware vSphere) and the backup infrastructure</li><li>Installation, configuration, and maintenance of servers, clients, and other IT hardware</li><li>Maintenance and update of technical documentation</li><li>Support for infrastructure projects, rollouts, and system implementations, as well as collaboration on the further development of the IT environment<br/> </li></ul><h4>Location</h4> <p>Pleidelsheim, Germany.</p>",
